WEBVTT

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.910
~ Manatsu no Daishanikusai ~

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:31.170
<b>mado ni utsuru futari no kage ga</b>

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:31.170
Our shadows, reflected on the window

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:36.830
<b>odoru you ni yeretteru</b>

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:36.830
sway like they're dancing.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:41.670
<b>warai nagara te wo douriatte</b>

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:41.670
We were holding hands with a smile

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:47.620
<b>hikari no mukou wo arukidashita</b>

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:47.620
and walked beyond the light.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:52.910
<b>kirari mabushi i mune</b>

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:52.910
How did your flashing and bright

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:58.980
heart start on the swing?

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:58.980
<b>yurasu de kimodouga hajimaru no?</b>

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:04.610
<b>otona ero ga iran nado madou</b>

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:04.610
I don't need magic and the like to look sexy.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:10.150
<b>aserazu futari de</b>

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:10.150
We stay calm.

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:14.440
<b>I wish you! kimi ga iru kara</b>

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:14.440
I wish you! Because you are here.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:21.560
<b>sumu-su hibi sae itsumo kagaye ite</b>

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:21.560
Always shining on smooth days

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:30.350
<b>kokoro ni sa ata shi matta dakaramo no sore wa</b>

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:30.350
I waited for it. Thats why

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:33.980
<b>koi no hajimari</b>

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:33.980
It's the beginning of love.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.230
Itadakimasu!

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:13.200
Delicious!

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:15.030
Really? Thank you.

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:17.230
That girl is bad at cooking, right?

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:20.060
You sometimes have to eat some delicious food.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:21.290
Well...

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:25.010
Is that so, Koutakun? You're so mean!

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:26.500
No, it's not like that!

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:29.460
Your food tastes good, too!

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:31.630
Honestly?

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:33.850
Yes...

00:02:40.610 --> 00:02:42.440
More than mother's?

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:50.040
You're so mean, Kouta-kun!

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:50.060
I didn't put it like that!

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:54.620
I'll be cooking some delicious food for a little while, Kouta-san!

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:57.480
Hey, how long do you intend to stay here?

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.330
Just go home already!

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:01.290
Kouta-sama, seconds?

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:02.070
Isn't that OK like this?`I'll go back if I feel like it.

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:03.580
Yes please.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.580
You!

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:10.430
You got it?

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.070
Do it slowly, Ren...

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:14.110
Leave it to me, Ai...

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:16.570
It hasn't noticed us...

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:20.210
Go over there!

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:21.740
Over there...

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:24.240
No, go here...

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.430
Here?

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:26.740
After all, go over there!

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:27.990
Over there?

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:30.020
I said here!

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.120
Here?

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.000
T-there!

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:33.370
WHERE?!

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.030
Hey, Yuki!

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:40.010
What, Ki-chan?

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:44.140
Was it necessary to come just before dark??

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:46.560
It feels like camping, isn't this fun?

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.210
It's summer break after all!

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:50.620
The ground was so hard that I couldn't get any sleep!

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:53.880
That's what camping is! At least we had a shelter!

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:55.760
Can't we end this?

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:57.860
It's kinda wrong.

00:03:57.890 --> 00:04:02.230
What are you talking about. This is part of summer break!

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:02.230
Hey, where are you shooting?!

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:04.700
Come on, it's not a big deal.

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:07.040
Thats not the point!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.260
Finished.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:23.660
It's hot...

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:33.630
It's about time...

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:38.900
Do your best, Tayura!

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:40.950
Lets do this!

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.720
Ki-chan! She woke up!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.380
Is that so?

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:50.830
Good morning...

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.930
That's old school.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:55.130
However about that...

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:55.130
What?

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:58.230
I wonder if shes always running naked inside her apartment...

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.420
Really!?

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:02.120
"What do you think?"

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:06.690
"How should I put this? Should I be somewhat more shy or more exited?"

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:10.220
"I may be a girl but the boys..."

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:11.810
She noticed!?

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:13.800
Let's stop that!

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:15.800
Peeping is just...

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.810
It's just an observation diary.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.800
To who are you going to show it?!

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:23.240
I haven't heard of such a kind of diary before!

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:25.240
Thats OK...

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:26.820
Wait!

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:30.270
Huh?

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:33.800
She didn't notice us?

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:33.800
Geez!

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:36.750
I'm hungry...

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:44.950
Another failure!

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:49.920
Sorry to make you waiting.

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:52.260
Have you finished preparations?

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:54.200
Yes, I'm perfectly prepared.

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:56.040
See?

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:59.180
What kind of preparations?!

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:02.950
All girls have their own kind of various preparations.

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:04.250
Want to know?

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:10.070
No, not really!

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:12.690
Even if you didn't, I did show it anyway!

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:15.600
Stop that please!

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:15.600
Oh my...

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:17.370
How improper!

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:22.110
Hi~

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:24.290
I'm sorry for letting you wait.

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:26.290
Then, shall we go?

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:28.110
Who's the improper one?!

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:32.290
If your dating someone, this is the least you can do, right?

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:32.290
Note: She's implying her Yukata.

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:33.490
Kouta-san?

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:35.990
I'm the one who's dating him!

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:38.980
Your past your prime, so stop seducing him!

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:40.170
Thats so mean.

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:41.720
I'm in good shape.

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:43.960
And I have these.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:55.810
What was that about? Don't joke with me!

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:57.910
Take care!

00:06:59.090 --> 00:07:01.810
She eats a lot!

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:11.230
She's back.

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:17.180
Now it's dessert!?

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:26.590
I'm full...

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:33.020
"Erm... Would you like to go to watch fireworks with me?"

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.830
"Really!? Yay!"

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:38.070
"Well then, lets meet this evening..."

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:41.190
All right!

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:45.280
I'll ask her like this...

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:53.280
There she is!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.470
Oh yeah...

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:05.940
Note: She's reading Greek mythology. In this case, Cassiopea and her nymph daughter, and Oedipus.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:01.250
The queen, together with the daughter and real father...

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:05.940
The grown up son did it himself and married the mistress!

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:08.770
What is wrong with this family!?

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:10.170
That's so disgusting!

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:20.330
Has she noticed us?!

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:37.060
Yo!

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:40.670
This is kinda rare, -

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:43.040
to see you in here.

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:46.100
Really?

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:50.040
Well...

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:50.040
Did you come for a book?

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:51.930
Or homework?

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:53.060
Um...

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:54.940
For homework... Maybe...

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:56.110
For homework... Maybe...

00:08:57.690 --> 00:09:00.850
That's great. Thought it's quite unusual.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:03.050
Is that so...

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:05.280
Yeah.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:07.310
Um...

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:08.510
Asahina!

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:09.760
What?

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.940
Well...

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:14.220
Wanna have this?

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:16.390
Not really.

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:36.060
They're so cute, Ren...

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:38.500
Yeah, they're cute...

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:10.320
It's hot, isn't it?

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:10.320
Yeah...

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:14.300
Is it really OK, -

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:16.500
to have you pay for this?

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.700
Yeah, no problem at all.

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:19.640
Well...

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:22.580
I kinda feel bad about it.

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:22.580
No, this is nothing.

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:26.010
Don't hold back, I'd buy you 5, 10 or 100 of these.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:27.420
I don't need that much.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.090
You're right...

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:32.530
Won't you eat?

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:35.050
Can I?

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.780
Of course.

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:38.660
Well, I'll take your offer then.

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:40.060
Don't hold back.

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:46.240
What were you trying to pull!?

00:10:45.230 --> 00:10:46.240
I-I...

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:49.310
I thought I could have a bite from yours.

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:51.310
No way!

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:16.660
Hey!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:20.880
You weren't imagining weird stuff just now, did you?

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:23.730
Weird stuff?

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:26.170
What kind of weird stuff?

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:28.170
That's...

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:33.400
Nothing!

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:35.690
Yes, I'm sorry!

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:37.820
Akane, -

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:40.890
you were the one having perverted thoughts?

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:40.890
Yeah, yeah, -

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:43.110
about the delicate and erotically stuff?

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:45.440
Wow, how amazing!

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:46.850
What are you doing?

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:50.590
Well, we're in the middle of a research project.

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.160
Research project?

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:54.620
The "Nezomu Ezomori observation" project.

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:56.360
Ezomori-san?

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:58.160
I'm here.

00:11:58.220 --> 00:12:00.160
When did you!?

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:01.260
Akane...

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:02.250
W-what?

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:08.690
Pervert.

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:09.860
I'm not!

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:17.360
I didn't know there was a place like this.

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:18.930
Pretty, isn't it?

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:20.780
It's just like a bed of flowers.

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:22.090
Thats right.

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.060
Hey, Kouta-kun.

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:27.170
What?

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:31.810
I want to do it with you on this flower bed.

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:34.360
Let's do it!

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:36.360
W-wait!

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:41.340
It's raining.

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:44.140
Geez, and we were just getting to the good part!

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:46.610
We should find a shelter from the rain!

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:02.060
My clothes are soaking.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.280
Let's stay here until it stops raining.

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:05.380
That's right.

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:08.570
Chizuru-san?

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:14.290
What are you doing?

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.390
What am I doing? I'll catch a cold at this rate.

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:19.060
You are right, but...

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:21.120
Take off your clothes too, Kouta-kun.

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:23.350
I-I'm all right.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:24.560
Take them off!

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:39.390
Are you worried?

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:41.390
Yeah.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.600
Is everything fine with Kouta-san?

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:52.430
Kouta-kun, aren't you feeling cold?

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:54.040
D-don't worry.

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:55.290
I see.

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:00.630
Hey, Kouta-kun...

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:03.040
Can I come to your side?

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.500
After all...

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.130
It's cold being alone.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:07.520
B-but...

00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:24.670
Don't run away, Kouta-kun.

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:27.420
B-but...

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:38.210
It's still raining outside.

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:41.090
No one is going to come.

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:58.350
That hurts...

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:03.350
Ch-Chizuru-san...

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.300
Please, stand up.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:06.500
Please, stand up.

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:07.680
No.

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.930
Why?

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:09.930
Hey, Kouta-kun.

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:11.380
Yes?

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:13.550
It's...

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:15.900
summer break now.

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:17.220
Yes.

00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:20.610
Let's do it.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:22.790
Do what?

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:26.750
The first time...

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:35.100
Kouta-kun...

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:42.030
You can't! Hide IT!

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:43.600
You can't! Hide IT!

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:48.110
There's nothing I have to hide from you...

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:53.950
You can look.

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:56.580
Look.

00:15:58.820 --> 00:16:00.860
You can't!

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.430
The rain stopped!

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:32.390
See you!

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:34.360
Y-yeah...

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:36.900
It...

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:38.500
is...

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:40.500
Well...

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:56.700
You suck!

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:57.890
That's right!

00:16:58.070 --> 00:16:58.860
Sucker.

00:16:58.900 --> 00:16:59.710
Shut up!

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:01.810
Well, do your best.

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:05.450
If it's going to become hopeless, we'll do something about it.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.620
Let's go then.

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:09.340
See you later!

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:21.830
Chizuru-san?

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:23.590
Well...

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:27.010
Please cheer up.

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:28.060
Cheer up?

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:31.450
Aren't you mad at me?

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.450
No!

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:35.210
Because I'm with you all alone.

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.210
It makes me really happy!

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:40.380
Don't you trust me?

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.100
No, thats not true!

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:43.050
Honestly?

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:44.020
Yes!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:44.880
Then...

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:47.690
lets make another wonderful memory between us.

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:49.550
Come.

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:51.870
I'll give you an amaenbou-san.

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:55.270
Note: "Amaenbou" means literally "spoiled child". In this case Chizuru is using it as metaphor.

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:53.710
Right here?

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:56.710
The twilights on summer, the sound of the murmuring river, -

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:58.070
and my Yukata.

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:03.690
The amenbau-san with the scent of the sun flowers is only now possible.

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:06.320
The summer amaenbou-san...

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:08.370
I'll give you plenty. Come.

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:09.470
I'll give you plenty. Come.

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:25.140
Amaenbau-san!

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:02.020
Yes?

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:03.860
Hello?

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:05.000
What is it?

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:07.000
Well, you know...

00:19:07.020 --> 00:19:10.510
This evening, there's gonna be fireworks at the festival.

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:13.220
Seems so.

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:16.650
You see that...

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:20.310
Say...

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:23.250
Would you like to go to the...

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:52.720
Asahina!

00:19:57.070 --> 00:20:00.990
I'm here because you said that you know the best place to watch fireworks.

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:10.330
So, where is it?

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:17.630
Oh, they came!

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:19.310
Seriously?!

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:25.020
Tayura, how good for you!

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:27.510
Akane, that's the spirit!

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:29.230
NO!

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:31.610
Look! We specially prepared a spot for you two!

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.570
Come quickly!

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:35.950
So what do you think? Isn't this place nice?

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:45.680
What?

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:47.740
Sorry to let you wait!

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:49.110
You're late!

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:51.070
I'm sorry.

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:53.780
Tayura-kun, lets go!

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:55.130
O-ok...

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:58.260
Was today fun?

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.440
Yes!

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:01.120
It was really fun!

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:02.400
Ah, I see.

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:05.560
Was it alright, your progress?

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:08.350
Kouta?

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:11.020
where have you been today?

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:11.020
Nozomu-san...

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:12.880
I've been...

00:21:12.930 --> 00:21:14.880
Where you flirting with her?

00:21:15.030 --> 00:21:17.660
When I wasn't around?

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:17.660
Em...

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:20.410
Isn't that alright? Since I'm his girlfriend.

00:21:19.650 --> 00:21:20.410
No it's not.

00:21:20.980 --> 00:21:24.180
I'm his lover too.

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:24.180
Don't get close to him!

00:21:39.970 --> 00:21:40.990
Kouta?

00:21:41.060 --> 00:21:42.960
Do you want to drink this with me?

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:42.960
Kouta-kun...

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:46.180
Let's drink this from mouth to mouth.

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:46.180
No thanks...

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:48.070
<i>Here.</i>

00:21:49.100 --> 00:21:50.440
What are you doing?!

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:51.930
Really...

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:54.320
Using school for such private matters...

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:56.480
Don't let it bother you, Yatsuka-sensei!

00:21:57.220 --> 00:21:58.740
Thanks sensei.

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:02.540
You too.

00:22:02.640 --> 00:22:05.260
Thank you very much!

00:22:14.510 --> 00:22:16.120
Sagara-sensei...?

00:22:34.430 --> 00:22:36.460
This is a good spot.

00:22:38.220 --> 00:22:39.720
Yeah, right!

00:22:42.320 --> 00:22:43.360
Yes!

00:24:05.880 --> 00:24:07.420
Kouta-kun, wake up.

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:08.650
It's morning.

00:24:09.550 --> 00:24:11.090
Let me sleep a little longer....

00:24:11.100 --> 00:24:15.060
No I won't. Summer break is too short. Now hurry and wake up.

00:24:16.900 --> 00:24:17.450
OK...

00:24:23.430 --> 00:24:25.830
Good morning, Chizuru-san!

00:24:31.080 --> 00:24:34.050
Good morning, Kouta-kun!

00:24:34.990 --> 00:24:40.790
<b>Mirai eto tsuzuite yuku michi</b>

00:24:34.990 --> 00:24:40.790
One day we will walk on the path

00:24:40.830 --> 00:24:46.650
<b>futari nara aruhi de yukeru yo</b>

00:24:40.830 --> 00:24:46.650
leading to our future

00:24:46.710 --> 00:24:52.550
<b>mitsume au manazashi no muku ogawa</b>

00:24:46.710 --> 00:24:52.550
Our eyes meet on the pure looking stream.

00:24:52.580 --> 00:24:58.710
<b>eien no kizu naka mieru no?</b>

00:24:52.580 --> 00:24:58.710
Can you see through the everlasting wound?

00:25:05.490 --> 00:25:11.220
<b>kono basho de anata ni koishita ano toki kana</b>

00:25:05.490 --> 00:25:11.220
I wonder if this is when I fell in love with you right here

00:25:11.270 --> 00:25:16.230
<b>Sekai ga kawatta youna kiseki</b>

00:25:11.270 --> 00:25:16.230
A miracle as if the world has changed

00:25:17.280 --> 00:25:23.120
<b>kono chiisana koto de kanjiraredeshi awase</b>

00:25:17.280 --> 00:25:23.120
Our feelings meet through this

00:25:23.170 --> 00:25:28.020
<b>houseki wa ko taisetsu ni ageru no?</b>

00:25:23.170 --> 00:25:28.020
Are you giving me the jewel you hold so dear?

00:25:28.250 --> 00:25:34.040
<b>sotto yasashi hikari ga sashikomu</b>

00:25:28.250 --> 00:25:34.040
The light is softly and gently illuminating

00:25:34.190 --> 00:25:39.590
<b>anata to iru ima ga tottemo ureshikute</b>

00:25:34.190 --> 00:25:39.590
being with you right now makes me very happy

00:25:39.640 --> 00:25:45.460
<b>shiawase no kaze ni tsuzumareo</b>

00:25:39.640 --> 00:25:45.460
lets turn into the wind of happiness

00:25:45.630 --> 00:25:51.390
<b>itsudatte anata no tonari ni</b>

00:25:45.630 --> 00:25:51.390
I will always be by your side

00:25:51.530 --> 00:25:57.350
<b>donna ni mo kitto egao ni nareru yo</b>

00:25:51.530 --> 00:25:57.350
Everyday will become a smile

00:25:57.410 --> 00:26:03.180
<b>unimei no koi wo shinjitteru</b>

00:25:57.410 --> 00:26:03.180
I believe in the voice of fate
